📌 Overview

This section presents an AI-assisted enhancement to the existing Financial Risk Classification Business Analysis project.

The objective is to identify opportunities where AI and process automation can improve financial risk assessment, reduce repetitive manual activities, improve application prioritization, and support loan officers with explainable recommendations.

The proposed solution follows a **Human-in-the-Loop** approach, where AI supports the decision-making process while the final lending decision remains with an authorized human reviewer.

---

# 🎯 Business Problem

The existing risk assessment process may involve several manual activities, including:

- Applicant data validation
- Financial information review
- Risk assessment
- Application prioritization
- High-risk identification
- Stakeholder communication
- Status tracking

These activities can result in increased manual effort, processing delays, and inconsistent assessment.

---

# 💡 Proposed AI & Automation Solution

The proposed solution introduces AI-assisted risk classification and process automation into the existing workflow.

### AI-Assisted Capabilities

- AI-assisted financial risk assessment
- Risk classification
- Identification of key risk factors
- Explainable risk recommendations

### Process Automation Capabilities

- Automated data validation
- Missing/invalid information detection
- Risk-based application routing
- High-risk application flagging
- Automated notifications
- Application status updates
- Audit record creation

---

